  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_4956.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>GROW Club Events ha acogido esta Nochebuena, en la plaza Siglo XXI de Onda, una memorable actuaci&oacute;n de Orkesta La Pelillo, que ha llenado la Sala 2 hasta las 6 de la madrugada, y&nbsp;el festival Remember con el dj residente Fran Ib&aacute;&ntilde;ez. Para este pr&oacute;ximo s&aacute;bado anuncian nuevas sorpresas para sus <a href=\"mailto:soci@s\">soci@s</a> y p&uacute;blico en general.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4894.jpg\" alt=\"img_4894\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4895.jpg\" alt=\"img_4895\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4896.jpg\" alt=\"img_4896\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4897.jpg\" alt=\"img_4897\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4898.jpg\" alt=\"img_4898\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4899.jpg\" alt=\"img_4899\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4900.jpg\" alt=\"img_4900\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelilloffestivalremembercrow/img_4902.jpg\" alt=\"img_4902\" style=\"max-width:1